        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1327_4569.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig dienst zuvor, er-
<lb n="2"/>samen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>fründt. Welcher massen auff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anruesf</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> mitburgers <persName resp="#ner">Hannsen Gloegglins</persName>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaübigen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">forderern</unclear> seiner
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inventierten</unclear> haab unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guettern</unclear> halber, ain
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">peremptorischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtstag</unclear> angesetzt worden,
<lb n="8"/>das haben e. e. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußm</unclear> bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwarten</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ofnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">edict</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lengs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvernemen</unclear>. So
<lb n="10"/>dann gedachter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gloegglin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear> e. e. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear> auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuthuen</unclear>, unnd zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> haab
<lb n="12"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guettern</unclear> zue unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sprach</unclear> haben unnd
<lb n="13"/>suechen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchten</unclear>. So ist an e. e. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/>unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> unnd nachbarlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuechen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>unnd bitten, sy wellen angesetzten rechts-
<lb n="16"/>tag, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iro</unclear> gebrauch und herkomen nach, was
<lb n="17"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierinen</unclear> pflegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürzenemen</unclear>, durch
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anschlagen</unclear>, oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">offenntlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkünden</unclear>,
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegehörig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuwissen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thüen</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>lassen, die interessierten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgebe</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stimbten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtstag</unclear> zerscheinen, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niein</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/>andt der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unwissentheit</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1327_4570.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="23"/>zuo beclagen habe. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Waß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> E. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="24"/>inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derglichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverdienen</unclear>, wellen wir
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jedezeit</unclear> willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anerbotten</unclear> haben,
<lb n="26"/>datum den <origDate when="1596-04-19" cert="medium" resp="#ner">19 aprilis anno 96</origDate>.
<lb n="27"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Hanns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lorenz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heroldt</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stactaman</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">N</unclear>. richter und
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urtelsprecher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stactge=</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">richtß</unclear> zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-40" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Kempten</placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1327_4571.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1327_4572.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="31"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuernemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsamen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear> der Statt
<lb n="33"/>Sanct Gallen</orgName>. Unsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besondern</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> und gueten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundten</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName>,
</p>
